# The Baium and Core cube (GrandBossTeleporter) standing inside Baium's boss zone (110002) answers its
# own page (onFirstTalk) and sends the character to one of Baium's points up to 100 away (onTalk,
# the second of its three points, the draws' offset 10,66 from it). Expectations are derived from the reference source; the
# reference probe stands the zone at its datapack coordinates, far from the fixture NPC.
character Pilgrim 60
random always 1
script script.teleport.GrandBossTeleporter
page default/31842.htm
page script/teleport/GrandBossTeleporter/
zone boss 110002 30 -20 70 20 -100 100
npc baium 31842 Folk 50 0 0

action baium
action baium
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=baium item=0 page=script/teleport/GrandBossTeleporter/31842-01.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{baium}_Quest GrandBossTeleporter
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S TeleportToLocation obj=player loc=113824,10448,-5164+-100 fast=0
  S DeleteObject obj=baium
  S ActionFailed
